rU0s4enlMODEwMTJYaVRHYW9iQmc0dW1Ha083ek1IU3V6TTA?oc=5","date":"2026-11-07","zh":"Atlassian 的雲指導將其成長故事置於顯微鏡下"},{"title":"Atlassian (TEAM) Stock Could Be A Bargain On Slower Growth Guidance","src":"Simply Wall St","url":"https://news.google.?oc=5","date":"2026-11-07","zh":"Atlassian (TEAM) 股票可能是成長放緩指引下的便宜貨"},{"title":"Atlassian Shares Fall 16% as Cautious Fiscal 2027 Guidance Overshadows Strong Quarterly Results","src":"Yahoo Finance","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinwFBVV95cUxPYm03ZllPSFZLd2hPaTROUG5HTVFtYmM5YVFnZUpXcWlZMEhyWFRPcmtxWnRzN3Z5NHZVclBTYmk4T3Z5UFVKRm1EWUdTeVJ2Z0sxMFVmMHUtUnJzUHczczFqTTdjZjRhOEI1UzMySEZNRnAzQ1ZIWmhkdXFFaWM2SDNyZDFhdnlfTFp5VDBXOFNmNk5za3NZLXF0VG1Xa1E?oc=5","date":"2026-11-06","zh":"由於謹慎的 2027 財年指引掩蓋了強勁的季度業績，Atlassian 股價下跌 16%"}],"themes":[{"name":"財報","count":8},{"name":"AI 人工智慧","count":2},{"name":"分析師評等","count":2},{"name":"雲端/軟體","count":1}],"biz":{"tenk":{"form":"10-K","date":"2026-08-14","period":"2026-06-30","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1650372/000165037226000036/team-20260630.htm"},"overview":[{"en":"Our deeply interconnected portfolio of apps, AI agents, and Collections, each with discrete value propositions, delivers solutions for software teams, IT operations and support teams, leadership and business teams. As an AI-first company, we have embedded AI capabilities across every surface of our platform, enabling organizations to orchestrate work effectively across both human and AI teammates. These apps, agents, and Collections are all built on the Atlassian Cloud Platform and data model: a common technology foundation that seamlessly connects teams, information, context, and workflows throughout an organization.","zh":null},{"en":"Since Atlassian was founded in Sydney, Australia in 2002, we've advanced our mission with a deep investment in product development to build innovative, high-value, and versatile apps that users love. Our software has been recognized as a leader in multiple markets and powers more than 350,000 customers worldwide. We serve organizations of all sizes, from small emerging companies to over 85% of the Fortune 500, across almost every industry, and in over 200 countries and territories.","zh":null},{"en":"Our product-led philosophy prioritizes delivering high-value, competitively priced software at high volume, enabling us to go to market in a unique and efficient way. We aim to grow our customer base, targeting small, medium, and large enterprises, and strategically expand our relationships with customers over time. To land new customers, we've engineered a frictionless flywheel with an emphasis on self-service, making it easy for customers to try and get value first and foremost and then virally expand within an organization. This allows our sales force to","zh":null}],"markets":[],"customers":[{"en":"Our go-to-market approach is driven by the strength and innovation of our platform, apps, and the market opportunity. Our model focuses on a land-and-expand strategy, with automated and low-touch customer service, superior product quality, and transparent pricing to land new customers and the initial expansion to new users and teams. This means lower customer acquisition costs and go-to-market expenses for new customers and initial expansions. In addition to our powerful flywheel motion, we have strategically grown our sales team to focus on expanding the relationships with our existing customers, particularly large enterprises.","zh":null},{"en":"For our flywheel motion, we primarily rely on word-of-mouth and low-touch demand generation to drive trial, adoption, and initial expansion of our apps. For our sales-led motion, we rely on a combination of field sales, solution sales, and a global network of channel partners to expand our presence within our enterprise customer base.","zh":null}],"competition":[],"segments":{"prod":{"end":"2026-06-30","items":[{"name":"License & Service","val":6262194000,"zh":"License & Service"},{"name":"Cloud Deployment Services","val":4410627000,"zh":"Cloud Deployment Services"},{"name":"Data Center Deployment","val":1830941000,"zh":"Data Center Deployment"},{"name":"Marketplace & Services Deployment","val":330740000,"zh":"Marketplace & Services Deployment"},{"name":"Product & Service Other","val":310114000,"zh":"Product & Service Other"}],"total":6572308000},"geo":{"end":"2026-06-30","items":[{"name":"Americas","val":3166368000,"zh":"美洲"},{"name":"US","val":2760458000,"zh":"美國"},{"name":"EMEA","val":2692588000,"zh":"EMEA"},{"name":"Other EMEA","val":2000288000,"zh":"Other EMEA"},{"name":"Asia Pacific","val":713352000,"zh":"亞太"},{"name":"DE","val":692300000,"zh":"德國"},{"name":"Other Americas","val":405910000,"zh":"Other Americas"}],"total":6572308000}},"peers":["OKTA","MDB","HUBS","DDOG","ZS"]}}